        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;The current automatic tracking integration is 17TRACK for J&amp;T; activation and provider credentials are configuration-dependent.&#10;FMRC notes do not rewrite courier events. Exceptions, corrected waybills and unverified evidence need review.&#10;The accepted shipping fee stays recorded; later actual courier charges do not silently change the Customer agreement." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
